CHAPTER.VERS:
And that which remains of the flesh and of the bread you

          {+}
         will burn with fire.

And you

          {+}
         will not go out from the door of the tent of meeting seven days, until the days of your

          {+}
         consecration are fulfilled: for he will consecrate you

          {+}
         seven days.

As has been done this day, so Yahweh has commanded [you

          {+}
        ] to do, to make atonement for you

          {+}
        .

And at the door of the tent of meeting you

          {+}
         will remain day and night seven days, and keep the charge of Yahweh, that you

          {+}
         will not die: for so I am commanded.
